          "text": "부트스트랩/런타임 정책: `runtimeEventsAutoAttachRecommended`",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "부트스트랩 렌더링 정책: `bootstrapMsaaSamples`, `bootstrapFramesInFlight`, `bootstrapPartialUpdateRecommended`, `bootstrapBatchRenderingRecommended`, `bootstrapPipelineCacheRecommended`, `bootstrapTextureAtlasEdge`",
